.TH DAWNPRO-GUI 1 "September 2026" "DawnPro-GUI 1.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dawnpro-gui \- GUI tool for controlling the Moondrop Dawn Pro AMP/DAC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dawnpro-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
DawnPro-GUI is a graphical interface for controlling the Moondrop Dawn Pro
USB DAC/AMP. It can change LED status, gain, digital filter, and volume.
Settings may be saved under
.IR ~/.config/dawnpro/config.json .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/dawnpro-gui/
Application files.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dawnpro/config.json
User configuration file.
.SH SEE ALSO
Homepage: https://github.com/shaypower/DawnPro-GUI
